# P12 W1-F (docs/phase12-brief.md 2.3 item 3, 9 "-modclass"): the runtime
# accountant. While a Class A module's screen is on top (here the cold
# Settings module's Legal page, the one Class A tenant built on p12 before
# the Extras land) it logs "modclass <name> class=A reads= writes= allocs=
# boost_pct= fps=" once a period and at the visit's end, and never
# "modclass viol" for a well-behaved screen; reads=0 in steady state.
# Needs the static modules build (the accountant follows mod_pass()).
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui-mod scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p12-modclass.script
# needs: modules
# reset: mainmenu

wait 4000
wheel +3             # Settings
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1000
wheel +15            # Legal (MOD_SETTINGS)
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 3000            # a whole period on top: one "modclass settings" line
shot legal
wheel +2             # scroll the page: pushes, no storage
wait 2500
key MENU             # the visit ends: "modclass settings ... end"
wait 1000
shot back
quit
